{"_id":"weapon-adhesive-grenade","name":"Adhesive Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"-","type":"energy"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"-","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>Every target in an adhesive grenade's blast radius must make a grapple check against the attacker's ranged attack roll or be unable to move. The adhesive lasts for 3 rounds. Once a character breaks free, that character does not need another grapple check to move through the affected area.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Restricted"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-adhesive-grenade","recordSha256":"f53f501d5a53fec1"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-concussion-grenade","name":"Concussion Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"8d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":400,"costNumeric":400,"damage":"8d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A concussion grenade detonates on contact and affects a 2-square burst. Make one area attack roll against the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst; a hit deals full damage and a miss deals half damage. Evasion modifies the result normally.</p>","economics":{"cost":400,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-concussion-grenade","recordSha256":"75c74f28c4b33db2"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-cryoban-grenade","name":"CryoBan Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>If a CryoBan grenade's attack roll also beats a target's Fortitude Defense, that target's speed is reduced to 2 squares until the end of its next turn.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Cold","Single Use"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Grenade","Area Effect","Cold","Single Use"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-cryoban-grenade","recordSha256":"b5ada5f242c08225"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-emp-grenade","name":"EMP Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"single-use"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"3d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An EMP grenade makes one area attack against the Reflex Defense of every target in its 2-square burst. Droids, vehicles, electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures take normal ion damage on a hit or half on a miss. If the pre-halving ion damage would reduce such a target to 0 hit points, the target moves -5 steps on the condition track and is disabled. Creatures without cybernetics take half ion damage on a hit and none on a miss, with no other ion effect. Evasion modifies the area attack normally.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Restricted","Ion"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Restricted","Ion"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-emp-grenade","recordSha256":"50f5ff7fc25c7467"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-frag-grenade","name":"Grenade, Frag","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"kinetic"}},"cost":200,"costNumeric":200,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"kinetic","description":"<p>A fragmentation grenade explodes on contact after being thrown and affects a 2-square burst radius. Make a single attack roll and compare it with the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst. Targets hit take full damage and targets missed take half damage; Evasion modifies this as normal.</p>","economics":{"cost":200,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-frag-grenade","recordSha256":"902946bae588994b"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-gas-grenade","name":"Gas Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A gas grenade detonates on contact and attacks every target in a 4-square blast against Fortitude Defense. A hit moves the target -2 steps on the condition track, or -1 step if the target has Evasion; a miss has no effect. Creatures protected from atmospheric hazards are immune. The gas also provides concealment within the blast area and between creatures inside and outside it until the end of the attacker's next turn.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-gas-grenade","recordSha256":"75beb8e026a04352"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-ion-grenade","name":"Grenade, Ion","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>An ion grenade explodes on contact and affects a 2-square burst radius. Make one attack roll against the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst. Droids, vehicles, electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures hit take full ion damage and those missed take half; ion damage can move them down the condition track. Creatures without cybernetics take half ion damage on a hit and none on a miss and suffer no other ill effects. Evasion modifies the area attack as normal.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Restricted","Ion"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Restricted","Ion"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-ion-grenade","recordSha256":"1d83895389e8dbb9"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-radiation-grenade","name":"Grenade, Radiation","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"single-use"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"3d8","type":"energy"}},"cost":500,"costNumeric":500,"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A radiation grenade affects a 2-square burst and resolves its area attack against Fortitude Defense rather than Reflex Defense. Hits take full damage and misses half, with Evasion applying as printed. Targets are also exposed to Moderate radiation for damage and Treat Injury purposes.</p>","economics":{"cost":500,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Illegal"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Illegal"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-radiation-grenade","recordSha256":"6249b4313019d1df"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-remote-grenade","name":"Remote Grenade","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":300,"costNumeric":300,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A remote grenade is programmed for remote detonation using the manufacturer's handheld detonator, which costs 100 credits. Its safety system prevents remote detonation of deployed grenades within 100 meters of the transmitter.</p>","economics":{"cost":300,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-remote-grenade","recordSha256":"59fc04afdf7e4fb6"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-smoke-grenade","name":"Grenade, Smoke","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"single-use"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"-","type":"energy"}},"cost":100,"costNumeric":100,"damage":"-","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A smoke grenade fills a 2-square burst with thick smoke that provides concealment and creates a smoke hazard. The cloud lasts 10 rounds.</p>","economics":{"cost":100,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Military"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Military"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-smoke-grenade","recordSha256":"2850157731789151"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-stun-grenade","name":"Grenade, Stun","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"4d6","type":"stun"}},"cost":250,"costNumeric":250,"damage":"4d6","damageType":"stun","description":"<p>A stun grenade explodes on contact and affects a 2-square burst radius. Make one attack roll against the Reflex Defense of every target in the burst. Targets hit take full stun damage and targets missed take half stun damage; the stun damage can move targets down the condition track. Evasion modifies the area attack as normal. Droids, vehicles, and objects are immune to stun damage.</p>","economics":{"cost":250,"weight":0.5},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Stun","Non-Lethal","Single Use"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Grenade","Area Effect","Stun","Non-Lethal","Single Use"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":0.5},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-stun-grenade","recordSha256":"ba28befd653a5f8e"}}}}
{"_id":"weapon-thermal-detonator","name":"Thermal Detonator","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"ammunition":{"current":1,"max":1,"type":"consumable"},"attackAttribute":"dex","attackBonus":0,"category":"weapon","combat":{"attack":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0},"damage":{"ability":"dex","bonus":0,"dice":"8d6","type":"energy"}},"cost":2000,"costNumeric":2000,"damage":"8d6","damageType":"energy","description":"<p>A thermal detonator has a timer adjustable from 1 to 3 rounds. When it detonates, make one area attack roll and compare it to the Reflex Defense of every target in its 4-square burst radius. Targets hit take full damage and targets missed take half damage; Evasion modifies this as normal.</p>","economics":{"cost":2000,"weight":1},"equippable":{"equipped":false,"slot":"hand"},"equipped":false,"proficiency":"simple","properties":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use","Restricted"],"range":"6 squares","rangeProfile":"simple-weapons","schemaVersion":2,"subcategory":"grenade","traits":["Grenade","Area Effect","Explosive","Single Use","Restricted"],"weaponCategory":"ranged","weaponType":"simple-weapons","weight":1},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"canonicalWeapon":{"corpusVersion":"5C.1","identityKey":"weapon-thermal-detonator","recordSha256":"9f93a3e6b431d014"}}}}
